    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/02441989cd8ea32c4d9eaca076c2085e.poster.avif?t=1753904625\" width=400 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/02441989cd8ea32c4d9eaca076c2085e.webm?t=1753904625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/02441989cd8ea32c4d9eaca076c2085e.mp4?t=1753904625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/65c26d5478902e6043c71c760ed0f2f3.poster.avif?t=1753904625\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/65c26d5478902e6043c71c760ed0f2f3.webm?t=1753904625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/65c26d5478902e6043c71c760ed0f2f3.mp4?t=1753904625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landhold blends the 4x, colony sim, and city-building genres.\u00a0 Key game components:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource and economic management for a growing collection of settlements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City-builder style zoning for farmland, residential, commercial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place public buildings like irrigation projects, way stations, and bridges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing route-based territory management.\u00a0 It's about the connections between places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/97d82fbe2b5c51a17e59622d5fde5289.poster.avif?t=1753904625\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/97d82fbe2b5c51a17e59622d5fde5289.webm?t=1753904625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/97d82fbe2b5c51a17e59622d5fde5289.mp4?t=1753904625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/02441989cd8ea32c4d9eaca076c2085e.poster.avif?t=1753904625\" width=400 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/02441989cd8ea32c4d9eaca076c2085e.webm?t=1753904625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/02441989cd8ea32c4d9eaca076c2085e.mp4?t=1753904625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/65c26d5478902e6043c71c760ed0f2f3.poster.avif?t=1753904625\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/65c26d5478902e6043c71c760ed0f2f3.webm?t=1753904625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/65c26d5478902e6043c71c760ed0f2f3.mp4?t=1753904625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landhold blends the 4x, colony sim, and city-building genres.\u00a0 Key game components:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource and economic management for a growing collection of settlements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City-builder style zoning for farmland, residential, commercial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place public buildings like irrigation projects, way stations, and bridges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing route-based territory management.\u00a0 It's about the connections between places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/97d82fbe2b5c51a17e59622d5fde5289.poster.avif?t=1753904625\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/97d82fbe2b5c51a17e59622d5fde5289.webm?t=1753904625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446780/extras/97d82fbe2b5c51a17e59622d5fde5289.mp4?t=1753904625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Landhold is a 4X city-builder. Explore a new map in every game. Expand territory by sending patrols to settlements and fortifications. Exploit resources by building farmland, mines, pastures, and lumberyards. Exterminate rivals with unique route-based combat.",
